OL,3,ABurnt out cars and shattered glass on
OL,4,AParis streets after protests turn to
OL,5,Ariots and looting
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance awoke to scenes of widespread
OL,8,Fdamage on Sunday after a day of riots
OL,9,Fand demonstrations, with shopfronts
OL,10,Fshattered, burnt out cars, charred
OL,11,Fbikes, and piles of glass and debris on
OL,12,Fthe pavements of Paris.
OL,14,FPolice arrested about 1,800 people on
OL,15,FSaturday as some 550,000 demonstrators
OL,16,Ftook to the streets for protests that
OL,17,Fwere largely peaceful.
OL,19,FThey were demonstrating against rising
OL,20,Ffuel prices, the cost of living and
OL,21,Fdeteriorating public services,
OL,22,Fincluding schools.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
