OL,5,Ariots and looting
OL,6,
OL,7,FGroups of rioters, some dressed in
OL,8,Fblack and wearing masks and balaclavas,
OL,9,Falso came out in Paris, Marseille and
OL,10,Fother towns and cities, with some
OL,11,Fsetting fire to cars and buildings.
